---
const adminAppUrl = 'https://courtside-admin.vercel.app';
---

<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <meta name="description" content="Courtside — La plataforma de gestión para clubes de tenis y pádel. Reservas, torneos, academia y más." />
    <title>Courtside — Gestión de clubes de tenis y pádel</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      :root {
        --brand-navy:       #223D7E;
        --brand-navy-600:   #1B3268;
        --brand-navy-100:   #E8ECF5;
        --brand-green:      #16A34A;
        --brand-green-700:  #166534;
        --brand-green-400:  #6DB84D;
        --brand-green-100:  #DCFCE7;
        --brand-green-50:   #F0FDF4;
        --fg-1:             #0F172A;
        --fg-2:             #334155;
        --fg-3:             #64748B;
        --fg-4:             #94A3B8;
        --bg-1:             #FFFFFF;
        --border-1:         #E5E7EB;
        --border-2:         #CBD5E1;
        --shadow-md:        0 4px 12px rgb(15 23 42 / 0.06), 0 2px 4px rgb(15 23 42 / 0.04);
        --font-sans:        'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      }

      body {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        color: var(--fg-1);
        background: var(--bg-1);
        line-height: 1.5;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        text-wrap: pretty;
      }

      /* ── NAV ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .cs-nav {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
        background: rgba(34, 61, 126, 0.97);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
      }
      .cs-logo {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
        text-decoration: none; font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .cs-logo img { width: 28px; height: 28px; object-fit: contain; flex-shrink: 0; }
      .cs-logo .court { color: #fff; }
      .cs-logo .side  { color: var(--brand-green-400); }
      .cs-nav-cta {
        background: var(--brand-green); color: #fff;
        padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 6px;
        text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600;
        transition: background 120ms;
      }
      .cs-nav-cta:hover { background: var(--brand-green-700); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }

      /* ── HERO ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .cs-hero {
        background: var(--brand-navy);
        padding: 5.5rem 2rem 5rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .cs-hero-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .cs-hero-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: #e2e8f0;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
        font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 999px;
        margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .cs-hero-h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
        font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.12;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: #fff;
      }
      .cs-hero-h1 span { color: var(--brand-green-400); }
      .cs-hero-p {
        font-size: 1.125rem; color: #CBD5E1;
        max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .cs-hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .cs-btn-primary {
        background: var(--brand-green); color: #fff;
        padding: 0.85rem 2rem; border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem;
        transition: background 120ms, transform 120ms;
      }
      .cs-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--brand-green-700); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; transform: translateY(-1px); }
      .cs-btn-secondary {
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); color: #fff;
        padding: 0.85rem 2rem; border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 1rem;
        transition: all 120ms; background: transparent;
      }
      .cs-btn-secondary:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }

      /* ── FEATURES ────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .cs-features { background: var(--brand-green-50); padding: 5rem 2rem; }
      .cs-features-inner { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .cs-section-label {
        text-align: center; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--brand-green-700); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }
      .cs-section-title {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
        font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin-bottom: 3rem; color: var(--fg-1);
      }
      .cs-features-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }
      .cs-feature-card {
        background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-1);
        transition: transform 120ms, box-shadow 120ms;
      }
      .cs-feature-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
      .cs-feature-icon {
        width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px;
        background: var(--brand-green-50); color: var(--brand-green-700);
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      }
      .cs-feature-icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
      .cs-feature-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; color: var(--fg-1); }
      .cs-feature-card p  { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--fg-3); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }

      /* ── TWO APPS ────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .cs-apps-section { padding: 5rem 2rem; }
      .cs-apps-head { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; }
      .cs-apps-inner {
        max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem;
      }
      @media (max-width: 600px) { .cs-apps-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
      .cs-app-card { border: 1px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 14px; padding: 2rem; background: #fff; }
      .cs-app-card.cs-app-navy {
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--brand-navy) 0%, var(--brand-navy-600) 100%);
        border-color: var(--brand-navy); color: #fff;
      }
      .cs-app-card h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
      .cs-app-card > p { font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.85; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
      .cs-app-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
      .cs-app-card ul li { font-size: 0.875rem; padding: 0.22rem 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
      .cs-app-card ul li::before { content: "✓"; font-weight: 700; flex: none; }
      .cs-app-card.cs-app-navy ul li::before { color: var(--brand-green-400); }
      .cs-app-card:not(.cs-app-navy) ul li::before { color: var(--brand-green); }

      /* ── PRICING ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .cs-pricing { background: var(--brand-green-50); padding: 5rem 2rem; }
      .cs-pricing-inner { max-width: 440px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
      .cs-price-card {
        background: #fff; border: 2px solid var(--brand-green);
        border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem 2rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(22, 101, 52, 0.08);
      }
      .cs-price-tag { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-green-700); letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
      .cs-price-tag span { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--fg-3); }
      .cs-price-desc { color: var(--fg-3); font-size: 0.875rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem; }
      .cs-price-features { list-style: none; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 2rem; padding: 0; }
      .cs-price-features li {
        padding: 0.38rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--fg-2);
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      }
      .cs-price-features li::before { content: "✓"; color: var(--brand-green); font-weight: 700; }
      .cs-btn-full {
        display: block; background: var(--brand-green); color: #fff;
        padding: 0.875rem; border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem;
        text-align: center; transition: background 120ms;
      }
      .cs-btn-full:hover { background: var(--brand-green-700); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }

      /* ── FOOTER ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .cs-footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-1); padding: 2rem; background: #fff; }
      .cs-footer-inner {
        max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .cs-footer-logo {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        font-weight: 800; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        opacity: 0.85;
      }
      .cs-footer-logo img { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
      .cs-footer-logo .court { color: var(--brand-navy); }
      .cs-footer-logo .side  { color: var(--brand-green-400); }
      .cs-footer p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--fg-3); margin: 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <!-- NAV -->
    <nav class="cs-nav">
      <a href="/" class="cs-logo">
        <img src="/logo-courtside-mark.svg" alt="" />
        <span><span class="court">COURT</span><span class="side">SIDE</span></span>
      </a>
      <a href={adminAppUrl} class="cs-nav-cta">Comenzar gratis →</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="cs-hero">
      <div class="cs-hero-inner">
        <span class="cs-hero-badge">Para clubes de tenis y pádel</span>
        <h1 class="cs-hero-h1">Gestioná tu club<br /><span>sin complicaciones</span></h1>
        <p class="cs-hero-p">
          Reservas online, gestión de socios, academia, torneos y más.
          Todo desde un panel web. Tus jugadores lo usan desde el celular.
        </p>
        <div class="cs-hero-actions">
          <a href={adminAppUrl} class="cs-btn-primary">Probalo gratis</a>
          <a href="#features" class="cs-btn-secondary">Ver funciones</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FEATURES -->
    <section class="cs-features" id="features">
      <div class="cs-features-inner">
        <p class="cs-section-label">Funcionalidades</p>
        <h2 class="cs-section-title">Todo lo que tu club necesita</h2>
        <div class="cs-features-grid">

          <div class="cs-feature-card">
            <div class="cs-feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"/>
                <line x1="16" x2="16" y1="2" y2="6"/>
                <line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="6"/>
                <line x1="3" x2="21" y1="10" y2="10"/>
                <circle cx="8" cy="14" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="14" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
                <circle cx="16" cy="14" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
                <circle cx="8" cy="18" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="18" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Reservas de canchas</h3>
            <p>Tus jugadores reservan desde el celular en segundos. Sin llamados, sin WhatsApps.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="cs-feature-card">
            <div class="cs-feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
                <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
                <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
                <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Gestión de socios</h3>
            <p>Alta de jugadores por invitación, roles diferenciados, historial de pagos.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="cs-feature-card">
            <div class="cs-feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/>
                <path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Academia</h3>
            <p>Grupos de entrenamiento, asistencia, clases privadas con tus profesores.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="cs-feature-card">
            <div class="cs-feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"/>
                <path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"/>
                <path d="M4 22h16"/>
                <path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"/>
                <path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"/>
                <path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Torneos</h3>
            <p>Organización de torneos con brackets automáticos, resultados y seguimiento.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="cs-feature-card">
            <div class="cs-feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M3 3v18h18"/>
                <path d="M18 17V9"/>
                <path d="M13 17V5"/>
                <path d="M8 17v-3"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Dashboard</h3>
            <p>Visión en tiempo real de ocupación de canchas, ingresos y actividad del club.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="cs-feature-card">
            <div class="cs-feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2"/>
                <path d="M12 18h.01"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>App PWA para jugadores</h3>
            <p>Se instala en el celular sin pasar por el App Store. Lista en segundos.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TWO APPS -->
    <section class="cs-apps-section">
      <div class="cs-apps-head">
        <p class="cs-section-label">Dos aplicaciones</p>
        <h2 class="cs-section-title">Una para vos, una para tus jugadores</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-apps-inner">

        <div class="cs-app-card cs-app-navy">
          <h3>Panel de administrador</h3>
          <p>Para el dueño y staff del club. Accedé desde cualquier computadora.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Gestión completa de canchas</li>
            <li>Alta de socios e invitaciones</li>
            <li>Control de academia y torneos</li>
            <li>Dashboard de ingresos</li>
            <li>Configuración del club</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-app-card">
          <h3>App para jugadores</h3>
          <p>Se descarga desde la invitación del club. Funciona offline.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Reservar canchas al instante</li>
            <li>Ver sus turnos y pagos</li>
            <li>Inscribirse en torneos</li>
            <li>Seguir la academia</li>
            <li>Perfil personal</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRICING -->
    <section class="cs-pricing" id="pricing">
      <div class="cs-pricing-inner">
        <p class="cs-section-label">Precio</p>
        <h2 class="cs-section-title">Simple y predecible</h2>
        <div class="cs-price-card">
          <div class="cs-price-tag">USD 50<span>/mes</span></div>
          <p class="cs-price-desc">Por club. Sin límite de usuarios ni canchas.</p>
          <ul class="cs-price-features">
            <li>Reservas ilimitadas</li>
            <li>Socios ilimitados</li>
            <li>Academia y torneos incluidos</li>
            <li>App PWA para jugadores</li>
            <li>Soporte por WhatsApp</li>
          </ul>
          <a href={adminAppUrl} class="cs-btn-full">Empezar ahora →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="cs-footer">
      <div class="cs-footer-inner">
        <div class="cs-footer-logo">
          <img src="/logo-courtside-mark.svg" alt="" />
          <span><span class="court">COURT</span><span class="side">SIDE</span></span>
        </div>
        <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Courtside. Hecho para clubes de raqueta.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
